-# The clone-repos init and GitService both reach github.com to fetch and maintain the
-# worktree bases that /repo's emptyDir starts without (entrypoint.sh clone_repos, and
-# `git worktree add` with cwd at repositoryPath). Under a CNI that enforces east-west
-# (the Calico cutover) the default-deny-all above became real and a fresh init could no
